  "html": "<p class=\"\">Hello, my name is <strong class=\"\">EJ Fox</strong>. I'm a hacker-journalist <a href=\"/consulting\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">available for contract work</a>. You can send me an email at <a href=\"mailto:ejfox@ejfox.com\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">ejfox@ejfox.com</a> (<a href=\"/pgp.txt\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">PGP</a>) or <a href=\"/calendar\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">grab some time on my calendar</a><span id=\"next-available-spot\" class=\"\"></span>.</p>\n<p class=\"\">My work focuses on design, data visualization, and storytelling. I believe the world is interconnected and editable.</p>\n<p class=\"\">I founded <a href=\"https://room302.studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://room302.studio\">room302.studio</a>, an innovation lab, to take on even larger projects and datasets. Take a look at <a href=\"/projects\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">some of my work</a> or <a href=\"https://ejfox.com/resume.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://ejfox.com/resume.pdf\">my resume</a>.</p>",
